        <item>
            <title>2.3.3</title>
            <description><![CDATA[
                <h3>What's New in v2.3.3</h3>
                <ul>
                    <li>Dictation starts about 4x faster — the recorder now shows live audio ~150 ms after the hotkey, down from ~610 ms.</li>
                    <li>The waveform animates as soon as the microphone is actually live, instead of sitting flat and then jumping into sync.</li>
                </ul>
            ]]></description>
